WEBVTT

00:01.427 --> 00:02.927
<b>[light music]</b>

00:02.967 --> 00:04.217
<b>You did it!</b>

00:04.257 --> 00:05.557
<b>Subaru, that was amazing.</b>

00:05.597 --> 00:07.267
<b>Whoever thought all
this up was pure evil.</b>

00:07.307 --> 00:08.437
<b>Huh?</b>

00:08.477 --> 00:09.937
<b>That's the first thing you say?</b>

00:09.977 --> 00:11.727
<b>Nothing about
that exam was fair.</b>

00:11.767 --> 00:13.517
<b>Only people who know
the same sky I do</b>

00:13.557 --> 00:15.277
<b>would even have a chance
at getting it right.</b>

00:15.317 --> 00:16.607
<b>So why ask it?</b>

00:16.647 --> 00:18.317
<b>The more I learn about
this master of yours,</b>

00:18.357 --> 00:20.777
<b>the more I get the idea he
must have been a real jerkwad.</b>

00:20.817 --> 00:21.987
<b>Oh, come on now.</b>

00:22.027 --> 00:23.867
<b>How can you say that,
and so seriously?</b>

00:23.907 --> 00:26.577
<b>It's not good to say such
mean things about yourself, OK?</b>

00:26.617 --> 00:27.577
<b>[sighs]</b>

00:27.617 --> 00:28.867
<b>Putting all that aside,</b>

00:28.907 --> 00:31.037
<b>this sure is
an awful lot of books.</b>

00:31.077 --> 00:33.497
<b>I'm so curious to see
what's inside of 'em.</b>

00:33.537 --> 00:35.457
<b>From the way
Ms. Shaula described it,</b>

00:35.497 --> 00:38.837
<b>it's a treasure trove,
one of endless wisdom.</b>

00:38.877 --> 00:39.967
<b>But--
[SHAULA squeals]</b>

00:40.007 --> 00:41.837
<b>Based on her
current reaction,</b>

00:41.887 --> 00:45.307
<b>this is the first time she's
ever seen this archive opened.</b>

00:45.347 --> 00:47.387
<b>We'll have to find what
we're looking for ourselves,</b>

00:47.427 --> 00:48.767
<b>I suppose.</b>

00:48.807 --> 00:51.307
<b>Subaru, the riddle
was only solved by you.</b>

00:51.347 --> 00:54.357
<b>So is it OK for anyone other
than you to touch these?</b>

00:54.397 --> 00:56.027
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:56.057 --> 00:58.567
<b>but, you know, if they made it
so only the one who answered</b>

00:58.607 --> 01:00.317
<b>could read them,
would the rest of you</b>

01:00.357 --> 01:02.317
<b>really have been
allowed to enter?</b>

01:02.357 --> 01:04.367
<b>Oh, you're right.</b>

01:04.407 --> 01:06.117
<b>For us to have gotten inside,</b>

01:06.157 --> 01:08.787
<b>this place must have
granted us the access.</b>

01:11.997 --> 01:13.877
<b>[eerie music]</b>

01:13.917 --> 01:16.457
<b>[gasps] Hey, look,
the letters are scrambling.</b>

01:16.497 --> 01:17.837
<b>I can't read them at all.</b>

01:17.877 --> 01:19.917
<b>This one's doing
the same thing over here.</b>

01:19.957 --> 01:22.507
<b>It's a form
of cognitive obstruction.</b>

01:22.547 --> 01:25.087
<b>But I can still read
the titles, I suppose.</b>

01:25.137 --> 01:27.427
<b>This one's Noah Libertas.</b>

01:27.467 --> 01:29.727
<b>This one says Aegon Voller.</b>

01:29.767 --> 01:32.637
<b>They don't appear to be
in any kind of order either.</b>

01:32.687 --> 01:34.187
<b>Those titles,</b>

01:34.227 --> 01:36.687
<b>do you think it's possible
they're all people's names?</b>

01:36.727 --> 01:37.937
<b>Ah.</b>

01:37.977 --> 01:39.107
<b>Yes, it looks like it.</b>

01:39.147 --> 01:40.687
<b>How strange.</b>

01:40.737 --> 01:44.487
<b>Glancing them over, I don't
quite recognize any of them.</b>

01:44.527 --> 01:47.737
<b>Of course, that may change
if I look at all of them, but--</b>

01:47.787 --> 01:49.447
<b>This sucks.</b>

01:49.487 --> 01:52.787
<b>What's the point in a bunch of
books if no one can read 'em?</b>

01:52.827 --> 01:53.787
<b>Huh?</b>

01:53.827 --> 01:55.327
<b>Hey, isn't this--</b>

01:55.367 --> 01:56.707
<b>Subaru?</b>

02:01.337 --> 02:02.757
<b>[eerie music]</b>

02:02.797 --> 02:03.797
<b>♪ ♪</b>

02:03.837 --> 02:05.587
<b>[gasping]</b>

02:07.177 --> 02:09.637
<b>[screaming]</b>

02:17.767 --> 02:19.857
<b>[NARRATOR]
A woman,</b>

02:19.897 --> 02:22.487
<b>there was a lone woman,</b>

02:22.527 --> 02:24.067
<b>a young woman,</b>

02:24.107 --> 02:26.857
<b>so young I'd hesitate
to call her a woman,</b>

02:26.907 --> 02:28.617
<b>but a woman nonetheless.</b>

02:28.657 --> 02:31.907
<b>[thumping]</b>

02:32.407 --> 02:33.867
<b>[gasps]</b>

02:33.907 --> 02:35.917
<b>[FATHER]
Typhon, let's go.</b>

02:39.837 --> 02:43.167
<b>[NARRATOR] Her entire world
was black and white,</b>

02:43.207 --> 02:45.127
<b>good and evil,</b>

02:45.167 --> 02:47.257
<b>righteous or wicked.</b>

02:47.297 --> 02:51.927
<b>And the one who divided
them up was her father.</b>

02:51.967 --> 02:56.187
<b>[crowd cheering]</b>

02:56.227 --> 02:58.477
<b>He was in charge
of punishing criminals,</b>

02:58.517 --> 03:02.067
<b>delivering consequences
befitting of their crimes.</b>

03:03.937 --> 03:05.527
<b>He was the scale that decided</b>

03:05.567 --> 03:08.107
<b>what was good
or evil in their world,</b>

03:08.157 --> 03:11.487
<b>a form of justice
he had hoped to teach her.</b>

03:13.617 --> 03:16.247
<b>But she wasn't
able to understand.</b>

03:16.287 --> 03:17.997
<b>[grunts]</b>

03:18.037 --> 03:20.917
<b>There was no simple answer
to judging good versus evil,</b>

03:20.957 --> 03:23.837
<b>for crime and punishment
were influenced</b>

03:23.877 --> 03:26.587
<b>by many different factors.</b>

03:26.627 --> 03:28.257
<b>But then--</b>

03:30.097 --> 03:31.387
<b>No, wait.</b>

03:33.597 --> 03:35.637
<b>[glass breaking]</b>

03:37.517 --> 03:40.187
<b>[whimpering]</b>

03:40.227 --> 03:41.017
<b>[door opens]</b>

03:41.437 --> 03:42.437
<b>[FATHER]
Huh?</b>

03:43.067 --> 03:45.477
<b>I'm so sorry, Father.</b>

03:45.527 --> 03:48.987
<b>I dropped it, and it broke.</b>

03:49.027 --> 03:50.197
<b>Hmm.</b>

03:50.237 --> 03:53.367
<b>[whimpering]</b>

03:56.407 --> 04:00.167
<b>You are right to confess
your crime to me,</b>

04:00.207 --> 04:02.377
<b>as well as apologize
the way you did.</b>

04:02.417 --> 04:03.787
<b>[chuckles]</b>

04:03.837 --> 04:05.627
<b>Huh?</b>

04:09.507 --> 04:12.927
<b>[NARRATOR] At that moment,
she finally understood.</b>

04:12.967 --> 04:15.177
<b>The scale that weighed
the gravity of a crime</b>

04:15.217 --> 04:17.347
<b>could only be
found in one place,</b>

04:17.387 --> 04:19.517
<b>and that would be
within the heart</b>

04:19.557 --> 04:21.937
<b>of the one who committed it.</b>

04:23.107 --> 04:24.107
<b>Hey, mister!</b>

04:24.147 --> 04:25.477
<b>Did you do something bad?</b>

04:25.517 --> 04:26.607
<b>Huh?</b>

04:26.647 --> 04:28.857
<b>Have you committed a sin?</b>

04:28.897 --> 04:31.357
<b>[cracking]</b>

04:31.407 --> 04:33.067
<b>[shatters]</b>

04:37.117 --> 04:38.407
<b>[screams]</b>

04:38.447 --> 04:40.577
<b>Did you also do
something that was bad?</b>

04:40.617 --> 04:41.877
<b>[gasps]</b>

04:41.917 --> 04:44.837
<b>Did you commit a sin?</b>

04:44.877 --> 04:46.757
<b>[cracking]</b>

04:46.797 --> 04:48.667
<b>[shatters]</b>

04:48.707 --> 04:50.587
<b>Who here has done
something bad?</b>

04:50.627 --> 04:52.387
<b>[shattering]</b>

04:53.677 --> 04:56.597
<b>Father, are you a sinner?</b>

04:56.637 --> 04:59.637
<b>Weren't some of the things
you did bad too?</b>

05:01.057 --> 05:02.557
<b>Typhon!</b>

05:03.897 --> 05:06.567
<b>[wind blowing]</b>

05:07.567 --> 05:09.527
<b>[NARRATOR]
She understood everything,</b>

05:09.567 --> 05:11.527
<b>and she was content.</b>

05:11.567 --> 05:15.117
<b>For now, she had at last
acquired the scale.</b>

05:15.157 --> 05:18.407
<b>The Witch of Pride went
on to question people's sins,</b>

05:18.447 --> 05:23.207
<b>deal punishment, and judge
criminals for their wrongdoing.</b>

05:24.207 --> 05:25.207
<b>[screams]</b>

05:25.247 --> 05:26.837
<b>Subaru!</b>

05:26.877 --> 05:28.377
<b>You all right?</b>

05:28.417 --> 05:30.757
<b>It looked like you were
really in a lot of pain.</b>

05:30.797 --> 05:35.507
<b>Did-- did I manage to avoid
letting it take me away?</b>

05:35.547 --> 05:38.887
<b>I'm still actually here, right?</b>

05:38.927 --> 05:40.307
<b>Typhon?</b>

05:40.347 --> 05:43.187
<b>Is that a name you're
familiar with, I suppose?</b>

05:43.227 --> 05:44.267
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:44.727 --> 05:45.897
<b>Are you nuts?</b>

05:45.937 --> 05:47.567
<b>[BEAKO]
What a rude thing to say.</b>

05:47.607 --> 05:50.937
<b>It's no different from any
of the other books, I suppose.</b>

05:50.987 --> 05:53.987
<b>However, you experienced
something else entirely.</b>

05:54.027 --> 05:56.117
<b>That's how I
perceived it, at least.</b>

05:56.157 --> 05:57.527
<b>Guess so.</b>

05:57.567 --> 05:59.827
<b>But then what about
this book is so special?</b>

05:59.867 --> 06:03.287
<b>This Typhon person was
someone you'd heard of before?</b>

06:03.327 --> 06:05.207
<b>It's hard to explain it.</b>

06:05.247 --> 06:07.497
<b>I mean, if you
don't know who she is,</b>

06:07.537 --> 06:10.417
<b>then that must mean
you didn't meet her before.</b>

06:10.457 --> 06:11.837
<b>It was at the graveyard.</b>

06:11.877 --> 06:13.127
<b>The graveyard?</b>

06:14.887 --> 06:17.087
<b>She was one
of the witches from the past,</b>

06:17.137 --> 06:18.677
<b>the Witch of Pride,</b>

06:18.717 --> 06:21.557
<b>a tan-skinned girl
as young as Beako.</b>

06:21.597 --> 06:24.557
<b>And she-- she was like
the living manifestation</b>

06:24.597 --> 06:26.767
<b>of pure and innocent cruelty.</b>

06:28.647 --> 06:30.607
<b>That book had me experience</b>

06:30.647 --> 06:32.987
<b>what I think were
her old memories,</b>

06:33.027 --> 06:35.817
<b>her life, or roots?</b>

06:35.857 --> 06:39.077
<b>Whatever it was, I
experienced all of it with her.</b>

06:39.117 --> 06:40.447
<b>It sure didn't feel good.</b>

06:40.487 --> 06:42.077
<b>And that's putting it lightly.</b>

06:42.117 --> 06:45.457
<b>You lived someone's
memories through their eyes?</b>

06:45.497 --> 06:47.037
<b>The more you say,</b>

06:47.077 --> 06:50.207
<b>the more it sounds like
the trial in the graveyard.</b>

06:50.247 --> 06:52.837
<b>Yeah, except that time, it
wasn't someone else's memories.</b>

06:52.877 --> 06:54.507
<b>You had to face
your own head on.</b>

06:54.547 --> 06:56.717
<b>But that was a piece
of cake, really.</b>

06:56.757 --> 06:59.217
<b>Yeah, easy peasy,
lemon squeezy.</b>

06:59.257 --> 07:01.467
<b>Well, putting you
two's tough act aside,</b>

07:01.507 --> 07:04.677
<b>you can relive someone else's
memories through this book.</b>

07:04.727 --> 07:07.057
<b>You could also look at it as
a means of retracing the past,</b>

07:07.097 --> 07:08.767
<b>I suppose.</b>

07:08.807 --> 07:11.067
<b>When you consider that, the
claim you can find anything you</b>

07:11.107 --> 07:12.647
<b>want to know in this library--</b>

07:12.687 --> 07:14.607
<b>[grunts]
[thud]</b>

07:14.647 --> 07:15.647
<b>Julius!</b>

07:15.697 --> 07:17.487
<b>Julius, hey,
keep it together.</b>

07:17.527 --> 07:19.027
<b>You can hear
my voice, can't you?</b>

07:19.067 --> 07:19.947
<b>[gasps]</b>

07:20.567 --> 07:22.987
<b>Ms. Anastasia, did you--</b>

07:23.037 --> 07:24.247
<b>Good.</b>

07:24.287 --> 07:27.827
<b>Just keep on breathing
slowly and deeply.</b>

07:27.867 --> 07:29.747
<b>You're gonna be just fine, OK?</b>

07:29.787 --> 07:32.917
<b>Could your poor brain not
handle these impossible books?</b>

07:32.957 --> 07:34.457
<b>Look at you,
trying to be clever.</b>

07:34.507 --> 07:35.457
<b>Hey!</b>

07:35.507 --> 07:36.547
<b>Ow!</b>

07:36.587 --> 07:38.217
<b>Don't be such a buttface.</b>

07:38.257 --> 07:41.047
<b>Julius, are you sure you're
going to be all right?</b>

07:41.097 --> 07:42.217
<b>I am.</b>

07:42.257 --> 07:44.767
<b>I'm very sorry
for making you worry.</b>

07:44.807 --> 07:47.187
<b>That said, it wasn't
particularly soothing</b>

07:47.227 --> 07:48.807
<b>for my heart.</b>

07:48.847 --> 07:51.477
<b>Wait. Do you mean the same
kind of thing happened to you?</b>

07:51.517 --> 07:52.647
<b>Yes.</b>

07:52.687 --> 07:55.187
<b>[ANASTASIA]
Balleroy Temeglyph.</b>

07:55.237 --> 07:57.857
<b>I think I remember
there being a general</b>

07:57.897 --> 08:00.277
<b>with that name related
to the Vollachia Empire.</b>

08:00.317 --> 08:02.737
<b>He was a former general,
to be more precise,</b>

08:02.777 --> 08:06.787
<b>a remarkable and virtuous
warrior of unparalleled skill.</b>

08:06.827 --> 08:08.497
<b>I faced him one on one</b>

08:08.537 --> 08:11.037
<b>and somehow walked
away with my life.</b>

08:11.077 --> 08:13.087
<b>But it was only
by a hair's breadth.</b>

08:13.127 --> 08:14.417
<b>[BEAKO]
That confirms my suspicions.</b>

08:14.457 --> 08:16.087
<b>Huh?</b>

08:16.127 --> 08:19.177
<b>One must be familiar with the
author to read a book in here.</b>

08:19.217 --> 08:22.847
<b>Also, they contain glimpses
only of lives past lived,</b>

08:22.887 --> 08:24.137
<b>I suppose.</b>

08:24.177 --> 08:26.507
<b>That seems like a fair
assessment so far.</b>

08:26.557 --> 08:29.727
<b>Wouldn't that mean all
of the books in this library</b>

08:29.767 --> 08:32.017
<b>are labeled with the countless
names of all those</b>

08:32.057 --> 08:34.977
<b>who have died in this world
since the very beginning?</b>

08:35.017 --> 08:36.897
<b>That's going to make this hard.</b>

08:36.937 --> 08:38.567
<b>If you're right,
it's going to take forever</b>

08:38.607 --> 08:40.107
<b>to find the one
book about whoever</b>

08:40.147 --> 08:42.277
<b>you wanted to look for here.</b>

08:42.317 --> 08:43.567
<b>Hmm.</b>

08:44.947 --> 08:46.997
<b>Whoever made
a library like this</b>

08:47.037 --> 08:49.997
<b>really was the biggest jerk
who ever lived.</b>

08:52.877 --> 08:54.457
<b>[MEILI]
Man, oh man.</b>

08:54.497 --> 08:57.087
<b>This all feels
so overwhelming at this point.</b>

08:57.127 --> 08:58.917
<b>Between this and the riddle,</b>

08:58.967 --> 09:00.757
<b>has enough happened
that you're finally interested</b>

09:00.797 --> 09:02.677
<b>in being fully involved?</b>

09:02.717 --> 09:04.427
<b>I'm not sure about that.</b>

09:04.467 --> 09:06.217
<b>But basically,
you're at an advantage</b>

09:06.257 --> 09:08.017
<b>if you know a lot
of dead people.</b>

09:08.057 --> 09:10.767
<b>Then you'd be able to read
more of these books at least.</b>

09:10.807 --> 09:12.307
<b>There might be
quite a few of them</b>

09:12.347 --> 09:14.477
<b>for me to stick
my nose in then.</b>

09:14.517 --> 09:16.267
<b>Books of the dead.</b>

09:16.317 --> 09:17.567
<b>Huh?</b>

09:17.607 --> 09:20.107
<b>[giggling]</b>

09:20.647 --> 09:21.607
<b>Nope.</b>

09:21.647 --> 09:22.737
<b>[whimpers]</b>

09:22.777 --> 09:23.817
<b>[giggles]</b>

09:23.867 --> 09:25.567
<b>Oh, I can't
believe you, Subaru.</b>

09:25.617 --> 09:27.327
<b>You're such a terrible man.</b>

09:27.367 --> 09:29.657
<b>That's a lot more
painful coming from you.</b>

09:29.697 --> 09:32.367
<b>I'd much rather it come
from Ram or Anastasia.</b>

09:32.417 --> 09:33.537
<b>[giggles]</b>

09:34.707 --> 09:37.207
<b>This might be weird
timing, but can I ask you</b>

09:37.247 --> 09:38.837
<b>some questions about yourself?</b>

09:38.877 --> 09:40.547
<b>Ugh.</b>

09:40.587 --> 09:43.007
<b>I think you have a few too many
romantic interests, though.</b>

09:43.047 --> 09:44.007
<b>That's not what I meant!</b>

09:44.047 --> 09:45.347
<b>So can you listen to me?</b>

09:45.387 --> 09:46.927
<b>I'm messing with you.</b>

09:46.967 --> 09:49.137
<b>If there's something you
really want to know about me,</b>

09:49.177 --> 09:51.017
<b>just go ahead and ask.</b>

09:53.137 --> 09:56.187
<b>I'll take you up
on that offer then.</b>

09:56.227 --> 09:58.767
<b>For starters, how long have you
been working as an assassin?</b>

09:58.817 --> 10:00.067
<b>Huh?</b>

10:01.317 --> 10:03.067
<b>Since I first started
doing this job,</b>

10:03.107 --> 10:06.197
<b>I figure it's been
five or six years.</b>

10:06.237 --> 10:09.327
<b>Although in my case, I didn't
exactly consider it working.</b>

10:09.367 --> 10:11.747
<b>It was more about my mom,
the one who took me in,</b>

10:11.787 --> 10:13.497
<b>and following all her orders.</b>

10:13.537 --> 10:14.707
<b>Hang on a sec.</b>

10:14.747 --> 10:16.497
<b>Are you saying you
were an orphan?</b>

10:16.537 --> 10:19.207
<b>Yep, thrown out
like trash as a kid.</b>

10:19.247 --> 10:20.957
<b>I was abandoned
in some forest</b>

10:21.007 --> 10:22.717
<b>when I was too young
to be aware yet,</b>

10:22.757 --> 10:26.297
<b>and the Mabeasts there
raised me up big and strong.</b>

10:26.337 --> 10:28.387
<b>[SUBARU] There are Mabeasts
that would raise a human baby</b>

10:28.427 --> 10:29.927
<b>and not just kill it?</b>

10:29.967 --> 10:31.977
<b>[MEILI]
Well, not any normal baby.</b>

10:32.017 --> 10:34.267
<b>But I was born already
having the ability</b>

10:34.307 --> 10:37.307
<b>to befriend Mabeasts,
so it was different for me.</b>

10:37.357 --> 10:40.687
<b>At least I'm pretty sure
that's what saved my life.</b>

10:40.727 --> 10:43.317
<b>Though, honestly, I think
my divine protection</b>

10:43.357 --> 10:46.357
<b>was the reason my family
dumped me in the first place.</b>

10:46.407 --> 10:49.367
<b>Kind of hard to know if it was
a good or bad thing, you know?</b>

10:49.407 --> 10:50.657
<b>[giggles]</b>

10:52.617 --> 10:55.617
<b>Hey, Meili, I'm just being
hypothetical here, but--</b>

10:55.657 --> 10:57.247
<b>What's up?</b>

10:57.287 --> 11:00.247
<b>It's just, if your parents'
books were here,</b>

11:00.287 --> 11:02.257
<b>would you read them?</b>

11:02.297 --> 11:04.547
<b>My parents, huh?</b>

11:04.587 --> 11:06.637
<b>And by that, you don't
mean my mom, right?</b>

11:06.667 --> 11:08.387
<b>Like my actual parents?</b>

11:08.427 --> 11:09.757
<b>[SUBARU]
Yeah.</b>

11:09.797 --> 11:12.057
<b>[MEILI]
No interest in that at all.</b>

11:12.097 --> 11:13.517
<b>[SUBARU]
Really?</b>

11:13.557 --> 11:15.977
<b>[MEILI] Don't get the wrong
idea about my reasons.</b>

11:16.017 --> 11:18.437
<b>First of all, I don't feel
any anger towards them</b>

11:18.477 --> 11:21.227
<b>for dumping me
or anything like that.</b>

11:21.267 --> 11:23.317
<b>To be honest with you,
they're not even worth</b>

11:23.357 --> 11:24.937
<b>that much to me, so.</b>

11:26.647 --> 11:30.157
<b>Anyway, if I'd said that I
was interested in reading</b>

11:30.197 --> 11:32.197
<b>their death books, then
what would you have done?</b>

11:32.237 --> 11:34.407
<b>I would have looked
for them, obviously.</b>

11:34.447 --> 11:36.037
<b>I mean, I can't promise
I would be able to find</b>

11:36.077 --> 11:37.617
<b>them right away or anything.</b>

11:37.667 --> 11:39.377
<b>But if you want to look
into it and find their names,</b>

11:39.417 --> 11:40.917
<b>I could, I don't know,
make time to--</b>

11:40.957 --> 11:42.747
<b>You really are the biggest
idiot on the whole planet,</b>

11:42.787 --> 11:43.747
<b>aren't you?</b>

11:43.797 --> 11:44.797
<b>What was that for?</b>

11:44.837 --> 11:46.587
<b>[giggles]</b>

11:46.627 --> 11:49.387
<b>So I had a thought.</b>

11:49.427 --> 11:49.677
<b>Huh?</b>

11:51.097 --> 11:54.757
<b>How do you think that more
books get added to the shelves?</b>

11:54.807 --> 11:56.177
<b>Hmm.</b>

11:56.227 --> 11:58.387
<b>Let's say, like,
if something were to happen</b>

11:58.437 --> 12:00.017
<b>and you drop dead
right here and now,</b>

12:00.057 --> 12:01.307
<b>would a book with
your name just</b>

12:01.357 --> 12:03.607
<b>suddenly appear
out of thin air?</b>

12:03.647 --> 12:05.817
<b>Now that piques
my interest for sure.</b>

12:05.857 --> 12:07.697
<b>Sorry, but I can't
exactly test that out</b>

12:07.737 --> 12:09.447
<b>for your entertainment's sake.</b>

12:09.487 --> 12:11.657
<b>[EMILIA] Sounds like
you two are having fun.</b>

12:11.697 --> 12:13.867
<b>So did you find something?</b>

12:13.907 --> 12:15.497
<b>Unfortunately, no, we didn't.</b>

12:15.537 --> 12:16.827
<b>How about you guys?</b>

12:16.867 --> 12:19.037
<b>No, I'm really sorry.</b>

12:19.077 --> 12:20.827
<b>We've taken
a look around,</b>

12:20.877 --> 12:22.587
<b>but the books aren't
arranged in any sort</b>

12:22.627 --> 12:24.247
<b>of order we figured out.</b>

12:24.287 --> 12:26.377
<b>They're certainly not
in order of name or date,</b>

12:26.417 --> 12:27.667
<b>at the very least.</b>

12:27.717 --> 12:30.257
<b>Put simply,
all we were able to find out</b>

12:30.297 --> 12:32.887
<b>is that we still don't
understand a thing.</b>

12:34.257 --> 12:36.467
<b>[SUBARU]
Yes, that's it.</b>

12:36.517 --> 12:37.767
<b>At least for the time being,</b>

12:37.807 --> 12:40.187
<b>this archive is more
than we can deal with.</b>

12:40.437 --> 12:41.977
<b>Hmm.</b>

12:42.017 --> 12:44.567
<b>Even if we try our best
to find a name we recognize,</b>

12:44.607 --> 12:46.397
<b>that person might not
even have the information</b>

12:46.437 --> 12:47.987
<b>we're searching for.</b>

12:48.027 --> 12:50.987
<b>And that makes a difficult
situation really difficult.</b>

12:51.027 --> 12:53.817
<b>In that case, we should
turn our attention elsewhere.</b>

12:53.867 --> 12:55.827
<b>Perhaps we're better off
taking the next exam</b>

12:55.867 --> 12:57.537
<b>for entry into
the second level.</b>

12:57.577 --> 12:59.037
<b>Yes, I agree.</b>

12:59.077 --> 13:01.207
<b>But we've explored
a lot of this area.</b>

13:01.247 --> 13:03.747
<b>So where is the stairway
leading to the next level?</b>

13:03.787 --> 13:04.747
<b>Good point.</b>

13:04.787 --> 13:06.037
<b>I haven't seen one.</b>

13:06.087 --> 13:08.257
<b>Considering
the jerk responsible,</b>

13:08.297 --> 13:12.427
<b>it seems possible finding
the stairs is part of the exam.</b>

13:12.467 --> 13:14.007
<b>A jerk, huh?</b>

13:14.047 --> 13:15.347
<b>Shaula!</b>

13:15.387 --> 13:16.387
<b>Come here.</b>

13:16.427 --> 13:17.637
<b>Oh, Master!</b>

13:17.677 --> 13:18.637
<b>Roger!</b>

13:18.677 --> 13:20.017
<b>I'm on my way.</b>

13:20.057 --> 13:21.687
<b>What's the dealio?</b>

13:21.727 --> 13:23.847
<b>Is there something that you'd
like me to do for you, Master?</b>

13:23.897 --> 13:25.477
<b>When you come up right
to me with your eyes</b>

13:25.517 --> 13:27.727
<b>all sparkling wide like
that, it makes me feel bad.</b>

13:27.777 --> 13:29.937
<b>But, well, we've been
looking for the stairway</b>

13:29.987 --> 13:31.237
<b>to the second level.</b>

13:31.277 --> 13:33.107
<b>Do you know where we might--
- Not a clue.</b>

13:33.157 --> 13:36.077
<b>I ain't ever been up higher
than the fourth floor before.</b>

13:36.117 --> 13:37.367
<b>In 400 years?</b>

13:37.407 --> 13:39.447
<b>Wow, that's really surprising.</b>

13:39.497 --> 13:41.407
<b>Shaula, can I
ask you something?</b>

13:41.457 --> 13:43.207
<b>You've been kept
in charge of watching over</b>

13:43.247 --> 13:44.877
<b>this place for all this time.</b>

13:44.917 --> 13:47.627
<b>You're the keeper of the
Great Pleiades Library, right?</b>

13:47.667 --> 13:49.547
<b>Exactamundo.</b>

13:50.007 --> 13:51.377
<b>All right then.</b>

13:51.417 --> 13:55.467
<b>If I had to make a guess,
I'd say there's four--</b>

13:55.507 --> 13:57.467
<b>no, maybe five?</b>

13:57.507 --> 13:57.847
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:58.967 --> 14:01.177
<b>I'm talking about
the number of secret rules</b>

14:01.227 --> 14:04.517
<b>you were given to make sure you
properly protected this tower.</b>

14:04.557 --> 14:05.727
<b>It's five, ain't it?</b>

14:05.767 --> 14:06.727
<b>[squeals]</b>

14:06.767 --> 14:08.147
<b>What do you mean?</b>

14:08.187 --> 14:09.727
<b>And they're
secret ones at that.</b>

14:09.777 --> 14:11.687
<b>What's all this about?</b>

14:11.737 --> 14:13.237
<b>[SHAULA] It's not what
you're thinking, Master.</b>

14:13.277 --> 14:15.777
<b>I'm not trying to be sneaky
or hide anything from you.</b>

14:15.817 --> 14:17.947
<b>I just didn't mention it
because you didn't ask before.</b>

14:17.987 --> 14:19.367
<b>I want to get that
in writing right away.</b>

14:19.407 --> 14:20.367
<b>So you can't go after me, OK?</b>

14:20.407 --> 14:21.367
<b>Whatever.</b>

14:21.407 --> 14:22.707
<b>Just spill it.</b>

14:22.747 --> 14:25.457
<b>Well, this is just
a hypothetical example.</b>

14:25.497 --> 14:27.337
<b>But if you tried to leave
this tower at any time</b>

14:27.377 --> 14:30.207
<b>without telling me first,
then I'd show no mercy</b>

14:30.247 --> 14:32.007
<b>in killing you
and your companions.</b>

14:32.047 --> 14:33.417
<b>That escalated quickly.</b>

14:33.467 --> 14:35.387
<b>It's not like I want
to kill you or anything.</b>

14:35.427 --> 14:36.847
<b>It's just an example.</b>

14:36.887 --> 14:38.927
<b>Besides, I don't have
any say in the matter.</b>

14:38.967 --> 14:41.767
<b>It's one of those things
I just can't get around.</b>

14:41.807 --> 14:43.977
<b>It's seriously exhausting.</b>

14:44.017 --> 14:46.557
<b>If you hate it that much,
why not refuse?</b>

14:46.597 --> 14:47.557
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:47.607 --> 14:48.897
<b>Hold on.</b>

14:48.937 --> 14:50.767
<b>Don't tell me you have
some kind of contract?</b>

14:50.817 --> 14:52.277
<b>If that's true,
then does that mean</b>

14:52.317 --> 14:53.737
<b>you're a spirit like Beako?</b>

14:53.777 --> 14:54.817
<b>Come on.</b>

14:54.857 --> 14:56.147
<b>That's obviously not the case.</b>

14:56.197 --> 14:57.777
<b>Honestly,
it's insulting that you'd go</b>

14:57.817 --> 15:00.117
<b>and compare me to flaky
little things like fairies.</b>

15:00.157 --> 15:01.827
<b>Why you gotta do me like that?</b>

15:01.867 --> 15:03.787
<b>No, I am absolutely--</b>

15:03.827 --> 15:04.997
<b>uh, huh?</b>

15:06.117 --> 15:07.827
<b>You're all really
freaking me out right now!</b>

15:07.877 --> 15:09.787
<b>Just so you know,
about 80% of us here</b>

15:09.837 --> 15:12.087
<b>have connections
to fairies, by the way.</b>

15:12.127 --> 15:14.757
<b>But if you're not a fairy,
then what are you?</b>

15:14.797 --> 15:16.837
<b>If you're not a spirit,
what reason could you</b>

15:16.887 --> 15:18.597
<b>possibly have
to cling so desperately</b>

15:18.637 --> 15:19.677
<b>to a contract like that?</b>

15:19.717 --> 15:20.717
<b>What are you saying, Subaru?</b>

15:20.757 --> 15:22.057
<b>Huh?</b>

15:22.097 --> 15:24.477
<b>Even if she isn't
a spirit or spirit user,</b>

15:24.517 --> 15:26.017
<b>that wouldn't change
the fact that she still</b>

15:26.057 --> 15:27.517
<b>has to keep her word.</b>

15:27.557 --> 15:29.977
<b>OK, I admit that I could
have worded that better,</b>

15:30.017 --> 15:31.017
<b>but it's just a figure of--</b>

15:31.057 --> 15:32.477
<b>Promises are important.</b>

15:32.517 --> 15:33.977
<b>And go.</b>

15:34.027 --> 15:35.567
<b>Promises are important.
Promises are important.</b>

15:35.607 --> 15:36.777
<b>Promises are important.</b>

15:36.817 --> 15:38.947
<b>Oh, damn it,
I got yelled at by Meili.</b>

15:38.987 --> 15:41.027
<b>This is all your fault
for being so dodgy.</b>

15:41.077 --> 15:42.027
<b>Out with it!</b>

15:42.077 --> 15:43.117
<b>Wow!</b>

15:43.157 --> 15:44.947
<b>Heck of a false accusation.</b>

15:44.997 --> 15:47.037
<b>Well, that's my master for you.</b>

15:47.077 --> 15:49.037
<b>All right, I'll talk.</b>

15:49.077 --> 15:51.627
<b>OK, I will now give you
a simple explanation</b>

15:51.667 --> 15:52.797
<b>of the orders I was given.</b>

15:52.837 --> 15:54.207
<b>So listen up.</b>

15:54.257 --> 15:57.007
<b>First, challengers
to the Great Pleiades Library</b>

15:57.047 --> 15:59.717
<b>cannot be allowed
to leave after they start.</b>

15:59.757 --> 16:01.887
<b>So that means we're all
stuck here right off the bat.</b>

16:01.927 --> 16:04.637
<b>However, if you
pass all the exams</b>

16:04.677 --> 16:06.477
<b>and reach the first
floor, it's no problem.</b>

16:06.517 --> 16:07.977
<b>You can come and go
as you please.</b>

16:08.017 --> 16:08.977
<b>Yay!</b>

16:09.017 --> 16:09.977
<b>All Gucci.</b>

16:10.017 --> 16:11.017
<b>Hmm?</b>

16:11.057 --> 16:12.437
<b>[SHAULA]
Just so you know,</b>

16:12.477 --> 16:14.517
<b>if anyone messes up
and violates these terms,</b>

16:14.567 --> 16:15.857
<b>I'll be forced to transform</b>

16:15.897 --> 16:17.817
<b>into a heartless
killing machine instantly.</b>

16:17.857 --> 16:20.737
<b>And the promise I made
to you before will be voided.</b>

16:20.777 --> 16:21.907
<b>I'll have to kill you.</b>

16:21.947 --> 16:23.197
<b>I guess
your rules rank higher</b>

16:23.237 --> 16:24.657
<b>than making me a promise.</b>

16:24.697 --> 16:25.827
<b>Man, that hurts.</b>

16:25.867 --> 16:28.327
<b>Wowee, I managed
to hurt my master.</b>

16:28.367 --> 16:30.117
<b>I guess I've leveled up,
no doubt about it.</b>

16:30.167 --> 16:31.247
<b>I've become stronger.</b>

16:31.287 --> 16:32.457
<b>No, I've evolved!</b>

16:32.497 --> 16:33.587
<b>This is my final form!</b>

16:33.627 --> 16:34.627
<b>It's sarcastic!</b>

16:34.667 --> 16:36.297
<b>Yeah, same here.</b>

16:36.337 --> 16:37.547
<b>Anyway, moving on,</b>

16:37.587 --> 16:39.587
<b>I'm bored now,
so I'll make this quick.</b>

16:39.627 --> 16:42.387
<b>Rule one, leaving before
completing the exams</b>

16:42.427 --> 16:43.887
<b>is forbidden.</b>

16:43.927 --> 16:46.887
<b>Two, violating any of
the rules in any of the exams</b>

16:46.927 --> 16:48.307
<b>is forbidden.</b>

16:48.347 --> 16:51.807
<b>Three, disrespecting
the archive is forbidden.</b>

16:51.857 --> 16:55.937
<b>Four, actions intended to
damage the tower are forbidden.</b>

16:55.977 --> 16:59.817
<b>Five, uh-- there is no five.</b>

16:59.857 --> 17:01.947
<b>So all in all, there
are four rules then.</b>

17:01.987 --> 17:03.407
<b>But well--</b>

17:03.447 --> 17:05.277
<b>Still can't help but be
suspicious of the one</b>

17:05.327 --> 17:07.697
<b>about violating
the rules of the exams.</b>

17:07.737 --> 17:10.157
<b>There are likely more rules
we don't know about,</b>

17:10.207 --> 17:13.247
<b>ones that fall under
rule two but are hidden.</b>

17:13.287 --> 17:15.497
<b>Sure that's all
the rules you were given?</b>

17:15.547 --> 17:17.547
<b>Everything else is
fair game then, ain't it?</b>

17:17.587 --> 17:18.877
<b>Yeah, I swear.</b>

17:18.917 --> 17:20.587
<b>And there was no lying.</b>

17:20.627 --> 17:23.927
<b>Also as long as none
of these rules are broken,</b>

17:23.967 --> 17:26.717
<b>then, well,
my body belongs to me!</b>

17:26.757 --> 17:27.967
<b>It's all mine.</b>

17:28.017 --> 17:29.017
<b>Oops, no!</b>

17:29.057 --> 17:30.427
<b>I mean, belongs to you.</b>

17:30.477 --> 17:31.557
<b>Uh, nah.</b>

17:31.597 --> 17:33.097
<b>What, you don't want me?</b>

17:33.137 --> 17:34.687
<b>But my heart
belongs to you forever.</b>

17:34.727 --> 17:35.727
<b>So take it!</b>

17:35.767 --> 17:37.437
<b>Don't want that either.</b>

17:37.477 --> 17:39.857
<b>Either way, if we aren't
able to leave the tower</b>

17:39.897 --> 17:41.397
<b>unless we pass all the exams,</b>

17:41.437 --> 17:44.907
<b>it's a lot like the trial
at the graveyard.</b>

17:45.317 --> 17:46.527
<b>Hmm?</b>

17:46.827 --> 17:47.827
<b>Hardly.</b>

17:47.867 --> 17:49.157
<b>If it comes down to it,</b>

17:49.197 --> 17:51.037
<b>we can still leave
if we defeat her, right?</b>

17:51.077 --> 17:52.497
<b>Easier than the graveyard.</b>

17:52.537 --> 17:54.497
<b>My master would
never do that to me.</b>

17:54.537 --> 17:56.537
<b>No, for he was
kinder and more</b>

17:56.587 --> 17:59.087
<b>big hearted than anyone
else in the whole world!</b>

17:59.127 --> 18:00.087
<b>Oh, crap.</b>

18:00.127 --> 18:01.207
<b>This is bad.</b>

18:01.257 --> 18:03.297
<b>Lying made me itchy all over.</b>

18:03.337 --> 18:05.337
<b>OK, then, Meili, you're up.</b>

18:05.387 --> 18:07.807
<b>Keep a nice tight hold
on Shaula's reins, will ya?</b>

18:07.847 --> 18:09.347
<b>[MEILI]
You can count on me.</b>

18:11.017 --> 18:12.267
<b>[groans]</b>

18:13.597 --> 18:17.067
<b>You know, I've had some time
to think a little bit now,</b>

18:17.107 --> 18:18.897
<b>about how the person
who built this tower</b>

18:18.937 --> 18:20.687
<b>wasn't a very honest person.</b>

18:20.727 --> 18:22.777
<b>When I start looking
through that lens--</b>

18:22.817 --> 18:25.407
<b>The way you phrased that
was just too adorable.</b>

18:25.447 --> 18:27.697
<b>But you're right.
Go on.</b>

18:27.737 --> 18:31.077
<b>It's about the possible
location of the stairway.</b>

18:31.117 --> 18:32.787
<b>I have a hunch.</b>

18:32.827 --> 18:36.417
<b>[footsteps approaching]</b>

18:38.087 --> 18:39.957
<b>[gasps]</b>

18:39.997 --> 18:41.457
<b>See, there they are.</b>

18:41.497 --> 18:43.007
<b>Not that I had any doubts,</b>

18:43.047 --> 18:45.837
<b>but whoever made this tower
was an absolute scumbag.</b>

18:45.887 --> 18:48.677
<b>I'm impressed you managed
to figure it out, Ms. Emilia.</b>

18:48.717 --> 18:50.387
<b>It wasn't on the
third floor, you know?</b>

18:50.427 --> 18:52.717
<b>So that's why I figured
that it had to be hiding</b>

18:52.767 --> 18:54.267
<b>in a place we'd already been.</b>

18:54.307 --> 18:57.187
<b>Right, but then was
this stairway not actually</b>

18:57.227 --> 18:59.687
<b>here when we were
down on this floor before?</b>

18:59.727 --> 19:01.477
<b>It's also possible
it had been hidden</b>

19:01.527 --> 19:03.277
<b>using a form
of cognitive obstruction,</b>

19:03.317 --> 19:05.147
<b>I suppose.</b>

19:05.187 --> 19:06.697
<b>[sighs]</b>

19:07.197 --> 19:08.407
<b>Great!</b>

19:08.447 --> 19:10.077
<b>I say it's time
we take this thing on,</b>

19:10.117 --> 19:11.947
<b>show it who's boss,
and finish this.</b>

19:11.987 --> 19:12.947
<b>Let's go, Beako!</b>

19:12.997 --> 19:13.907
<b>[screaming]</b>

19:13.947 --> 19:15.827
<b>S-Subaru,
hold on! Wait!</b>

19:15.867 --> 19:17.457
<b>[BEAKO]
Put me down!</b>

19:17.497 --> 19:19.997
<b>[screams]</b>

19:20.997 --> 19:22.707
<b>Gotcha, gotcha,
gotcha, gotcha, gotcha!</b>

19:22.747 --> 19:23.757
<b>That's enough!</b>

19:23.797 --> 19:25.007
<b>Stop, I suppose!</b>

19:25.047 --> 19:26.467
<b>Come on!
I said, stop!</b>

19:26.507 --> 19:28.177
<b>Gotcha, gotcha,
gotcha, gotcha, gotcha,</b>

19:28.217 --> 19:29.547
<b>gotcha, gotcha, gotcha!</b>

19:29.597 --> 19:33.267
<b>[screaming]</b>

19:38.097 --> 19:39.937
<b>[shouts]</b>

19:39.977 --> 19:41.267
<b>[BEAKO yelps]</b>

19:45.937 --> 19:48.987
<b>So it's another blindingly
white room, huh?</b>

19:49.027 --> 19:50.067
<b>I suppose.</b>

19:50.117 --> 19:51.077
<b>[sighs]</b>

19:51.117 --> 19:52.907
<b>This again?</b>

19:52.947 --> 19:55.657
<b>If this is the second
floor I was expecting, then--</b>

19:55.697 --> 19:58.667
<b>The next exam should
be beginning shortly.</b>

19:58.707 --> 20:01.877
<b>In fact, I'm guessing that
will be the trigger, I suppose.</b>

20:05.587 --> 20:08.627
<b>I'm assuming that's supposed
to be some kind of selection</b>

